# Local AI gateways (OmniRoute, LiteLLM, proxies). Development only — the vision
# provider refuses a non-OpenRouter base URL when PATHYAM_ENV=production. These
# entries stop an install inside the repo, or its local state, ever being committed:
# a gateway's store holds upstream provider credentials.
.omniroute/
omniroute/
omni/
*.omniroute.log
